# Feralas (Horde) - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 9 flagged rares, the Perfect Yeti Hide
# item-start hunt, and the fixed world containers of Feralas a Horde player
# can actually open. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end of the core
# route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not up never
# holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local Forever game data
# (questie-forever); signature drops are verified sole-drops in the item
# data. Respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so none are stated. The
# three Dire Maul rares sit far above the 38-50 band and are not listed.
# No rare in this guide is a giver, ender, or objective of any
# Horde core-contracted quest; the 7738 hunt points at the core guide and
# carries no accept/turnin lines. No tame lines ship (see
# docs/companion-unverified.md). See
# docs/feralas-horde-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory.
guide butler-routes-completionist/feralas-horde-rares
title Feralas (Horde) - Rares & Treasures
levels 38-50
zone Feralas
faction Horde
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords feralas, horde, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Lady Szallah — the far south

  zone map 1444

  goto 28.2,67.6
  kill 5343 optional
  collect 284850 "Naga Caster's Staff" optional
  note Level 46 rare, flagged rare in the data, single confirmed point far south.
  note The Staff drops only from Szallah anywhere in the data; anything else is ordinary greens. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

