step Perfect Yeti Hide hunt — the Feral Scar grounds

  zone map 1444

  loop
  goto 51.8,30.79
  goto 52.38,29.74
  goto 52.54,31.75
  goto 52.94,30.4
  goto 53.28,31.85
  goto 54.39,33.1
  goto 54.83,33.05
  goto 55.01,32.52
  kill 5296 optional
  collect 18972 "Perfect Yeti Hide" optional
  note The Hide starts core-contracted quest 7738 in your bags — take the quest there and hand it in at Jangdor Swiftstrider; the core route owns the accept and turnin, this guide only hunts the drop.
  note The Hide drops from the Rage Scar Yeti here and from three more yetis nearby — the Elder Rage Scar, the Ferocious Rage Scar, and the Lurking Feral Scar; those are the only droppers anywhere in the data.

